# Production build — Competitive Radar V1 static snapshot deploy.
#
# All pages are prerendered from public/radar-static/radar.json at build time.
# There is no FastAPI backend, no serverless function, no proxy and no model
# API key. No environment variables are required on Vercel.
#
# Vercel project settings: Root directory = web, Framework preset = Next.js.
# The weekly GitHub Actions run commits a refreshed radar.json, which triggers
# a redeploy. See docs/DEPLOYMENT.md.
#
# Optional absolute deploy URL (only needed if canonical/OG URLs are added):
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://your-deploy-domain.example.com
